1
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:15,550
♪I lean and gaze at misty waves afar♪

2
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:18,320
♪Tears fall on the ancient road
'neath the setting sun♪

3
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:21,460
♪One lone shadow on the cold river♪

4
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,910
♪In dreams, I return to the old window♪

5
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:28,670
♪Mountains stretch, the road home fades♪

6
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:32,030
♪A flute cries out, hooves hurry on♪

7
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:34,790
♪My heart adrift beneath a frosted moon♪

8
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:38,220
♪Drinking alone, I mourn our parting♪

9
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:40,050
♪Night turns cold, wind stirs the veil♪

10
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,760
♪Old robes recall forgotten days♪

11
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,570
♪Heart sore, a lone goose flies south♪

12
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,230
♪Where shall I send this letter?♪

13
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:47,760
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

14
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:49,000
♪Love runs deep, dreams linger on♪

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,390
♪Only sorrow remains♪

16
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,340
♪A cup of wine, my shadow makes us two♪

17
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:54,980
♪Drunk and lost through flashing blades♪

18
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:56,870
♪I curse how swiftly the years pass by♪

19
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,580
♪The wandering road goes on♪

20
00:00:58,590 --> 00:01:01,020
♪Desolate, time frosts my youthful hair♪

21
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:02,340
♪Through the years, love still burns♪

22
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:04,530
♪A thousand tears fall♪

23
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:08,030
♪Worlds apart, tears stain my sleeves♪

24
00:01:08,150 --> 00:01:11,300
♪Old dreams haunt my heart,
tears cloud my eyes♪

25
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:13,340
♪Heartbroken, soul-worn,
pain won't fade♪

26
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:14,820
♪Moonlight westward, the night drags on♪

27
00:01:14,830 --> 00:01:17,920
♪The years have left their scars♪

28
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:21,280
♪Autumn winds sweep leaves;
shadows pair♪

29
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:24,590
♪The past fades like smoke;
tears fall♪

30
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:26,820
♪My heart lies broken♪

31
00:01:26,830 --> 00:01:30,150
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

32
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:34,980
[Love Legend]

33
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:38,780
[Episode 21]

34
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:41,280
To make him Crown Prince instead?

35
00:01:41,280 --> 00:01:42,420
Is that important?

36
00:01:42,610 --> 00:01:43,790
What nonsense is that?

37
00:01:44,520 --> 00:01:45,680
The one after your position

38
00:01:46,070 --> 00:01:47,400
was never Pei Zhao.

39
00:01:47,620 --> 00:01:47,970
It was...

40
00:01:49,700 --> 00:01:50,940
Why did you stop?

41
00:01:56,590 --> 00:01:57,170
Forget it.

42
00:01:58,200 --> 00:01:59,200
Just get ready.

43
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:01,070
Don't let Yun Shao escape.

44
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:02,790
In three days,

45
00:02:03,590 --> 00:02:04,790
the Blood Jade Ritual begins.

46
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:06,950
I

47
00:02:07,510 --> 00:02:09,390
thank you, Mother Consort.

48
00:02:38,590 --> 00:02:39,680
What are you looking at, Shao?

49
00:02:42,900 --> 00:02:43,510
A blood-jade cup.

50
00:02:45,570 --> 00:02:47,400
Mother Consort gave it to me

51
00:02:47,510 --> 00:02:48,360
on my tenth birthday.

52
00:02:52,630 --> 00:02:53,680
A phoenix adorns the cup,

53
00:02:54,320 --> 00:02:55,200
fragrant wine fills the air.

54
00:02:56,630 --> 00:02:58,050
I wonder what happens

55
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,310
when blood touches it.

56
00:03:03,940 --> 00:03:05,430
They died from ordinary blades,

57
00:03:05,630 --> 00:03:07,040
while you survived
seven blood-jade hairpins.

58
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:08,840
My blood is more useful?

59
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:10,230
He was wounded by a blood-jade weapon

60
00:03:10,650 --> 00:03:11,760
while fighting the rebels.

61
00:03:12,440 --> 00:03:13,360
It's been two years,

62
00:03:13,750 --> 00:03:14,830
and the wound still hasn't healed.

63
00:03:15,190 --> 00:03:16,600
The ore is corrosive.

64
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:18,830
Once you're cut by a blood-jade weapon,

65
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:20,400
the wound is corroded

66
00:03:20,750 --> 00:03:21,590
and rarely heals.

67
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:23,030
But my wounds

68
00:03:23,250 --> 00:03:24,090
healed quickly.

69
00:03:25,590 --> 00:03:28,190
Only royal blood makes blood jade glow.

70
00:03:39,360 --> 00:03:41,300
Yong has three grades of blood jade.
Low, mid, and top.

71
00:03:42,750 --> 00:03:43,820
Low grade makes vessels.

72
00:03:45,820 --> 00:03:46,980
Mid grade makes weapons.

73
00:03:48,070 --> 00:03:48,870
Top grade

74
00:03:49,950 --> 00:03:52,000
is reserved for the royal family.

75
00:03:55,700 --> 00:03:57,400
Blood from a prince or princess

76
00:03:57,840 --> 00:03:59,190
dripped into this cup

77
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:01,010
makes it shimmer

78
00:04:02,910 --> 00:04:03,890
like a miracle.

79
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:26,070
If you already know,

80
00:04:27,310 --> 00:04:29,120
why stay in the Eastern Palace?

81
00:04:30,870 --> 00:04:31,920
The Noble Consort

82
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:34,040
controls everything now.

83
00:04:35,070 --> 00:04:37,160
I don't care about your power struggle.

84
00:04:41,580 --> 00:04:43,920
I only want to meet my real father

85
00:04:45,290 --> 00:04:46,360
to find closure.

86
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:52,510
After that,

87
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:54,480
I'll give you my blood

88
00:04:55,310 --> 00:04:57,000
for your Blood Jade Ritual.

89
00:04:57,720 --> 00:04:58,720
I lied to you.

90
00:04:59,300 --> 00:05:00,070
You don't blame me,

91
00:05:00,430 --> 00:05:01,430
and you'd still help me?

92
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:04,950
That's fate.

93
00:05:05,510 --> 00:05:06,430
No one else to blame.

94
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:09,160
Besides, Yong

95
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:11,390
can't take more chaos.

96
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:17,920
Just promise me

97
00:05:19,390 --> 00:05:21,000
you'll be a good ruler.

98
00:05:25,750 --> 00:05:26,240
All right.

99
00:05:26,830 --> 00:05:27,630
I promise.

100
00:05:28,390 --> 00:05:29,630
Once I become Emperor,

101
00:05:30,070 --> 00:05:31,380
I'll rule with kindness.

102
00:05:34,480 --> 00:05:35,560
I'll make you Empress,

103
00:05:36,630 --> 00:05:37,480
protect you forever,

104
00:05:37,750 --> 00:05:38,430
love you,

105
00:05:38,430 --> 00:05:39,040
care for you,

106
00:05:39,870 --> 00:05:41,920
and never fail you like Pei Zhao did.

107
00:05:46,300 --> 00:05:48,620
[Tianxuan Village]

108
00:05:49,310 --> 00:05:50,120
If the mother Gu activates,

109
00:05:50,390 --> 00:05:51,190
the child Gu will die.

110
00:05:51,430 --> 00:05:52,310
To save Yun Shao,

111
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:53,600
I need your help.

112
00:06:10,760 --> 00:06:12,180
Another idiot.

113
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:25,430
Does your hand still hurt?

114
00:06:28,880 --> 00:06:30,290
I couldn't block his move.

115
00:06:30,990 --> 00:06:32,070
Next time, remember to dodge.

116
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:33,860
It doesn't hurt now.

117
00:06:34,930 --> 00:06:35,240
Brother.

118
00:06:35,860 --> 00:06:37,030
How are Shandou and the others?

119
00:06:37,300 --> 00:06:38,160
They're all settled.

120
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:39,920
Madam Yun's idea worked.

121
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:41,770
That abandoned mine is remotely located,

122
00:06:42,160 --> 00:06:43,340
and has suffered past tremors.

123
00:06:43,420 --> 00:06:44,110
Strewn with loose rubble,

124
00:06:44,110 --> 00:06:44,800
it's easy to defend and hard to breach.

125
00:06:46,420 --> 00:06:46,950
Good.

126
00:06:49,160 --> 00:06:49,650
Brother.

127
00:06:50,210 --> 00:06:51,630
I'm a little tired today.

128
00:06:51,630 --> 00:06:52,600
You go ahead.

129
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:53,410
I want to sleep early.

130
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:55,300
Sleep in broad daylight?

131
00:06:56,920 --> 00:06:58,220
I just want to sleep.

132
00:06:58,220 --> 00:06:59,160
Go.

133
00:06:59,160 --> 00:07:00,270
Go, go.

134
00:07:00,270 --> 00:07:00,920
What's wrong with you?

135
00:07:01,530 --> 00:07:02,270
Go.

136
00:07:02,270 --> 00:07:02,980
Go, go.

137
00:07:03,430 --> 00:07:03,790
Ruoli.

138
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:06,310
What's wrong?

139
00:07:10,750 --> 00:07:11,560
Strange.

140
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:13,220
She usually scowls

141
00:07:13,430 --> 00:07:14,630
whenever Lord Pei comes up.

142
00:07:15,990 --> 00:07:17,360
Why no reaction today?

143
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:29,000
Report, Commander.

144
00:07:29,540 --> 00:07:31,090
Scouts found Gu Qingyan's trail.

145
00:07:31,770 --> 00:07:32,160
Let's go

146
00:07:32,170 --> 00:07:32,650
check it out.

147
00:07:42,570 --> 00:07:43,280
Leave us.

148
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:55,720
Hurry.

149
00:08:18,270 --> 00:08:19,560
Remove your veil.

150
00:08:33,510 --> 00:08:34,320
Your Highness.

151
00:08:35,830 --> 00:08:37,000
Pour me a cup of tea.

152
00:08:39,080 --> 00:08:40,480
I want to show a daughter's devotion

153
00:08:41,510 --> 00:08:42,720
and offer Father a cup.

154
00:08:48,150 --> 00:08:48,730
Pour it.

155
00:08:59,320 --> 00:09:00,390
The situation is urgent.

156
00:09:00,390 --> 00:09:02,150
I need a token to prove my identity.

157
00:09:22,720 --> 00:09:23,780
Traitors are threatening the realm.

158
00:09:24,340 --> 00:09:25,490
Though I am a woman,

159
00:09:25,910 --> 00:09:27,070
I still wish to save the people.

160
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:29,860
Today I take this military tally,

161
00:09:30,760 --> 00:09:34,070
hoping to restore peace to Yong.

162
00:09:35,540 --> 00:09:36,070
Father.

163
00:09:37,130 --> 00:09:37,630
Take care.

164
00:09:54,930 --> 00:09:55,390
Go.

165
00:10:17,390 --> 00:10:17,870
Well...

166
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:20,030
I did everything you asked.

167
00:10:21,390 --> 00:10:21,910
Tonight,

168
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:23,750
may I...

169
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:27,030
Your Highness, please show restraint.

170
00:10:31,600 --> 00:10:32,510
Yun Shao.

171
00:10:32,510 --> 00:10:33,360
You misunderstand.

172
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:35,270
I just want to talk with you.

173
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:37,720
It's late.

174
00:10:39,240 --> 00:10:40,510
You should get some rest.

175
00:10:43,390 --> 00:10:44,080
All right.

176
00:10:44,910 --> 00:10:46,240
I'll come see you tomorrow.

177
00:10:57,200 --> 00:10:57,600
There.

178
00:11:20,240 --> 00:11:21,270
Chang'an

179
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:24,200
didn't suffer much

180
00:11:25,250 --> 00:11:26,390
when he died.

181
00:11:33,840 --> 00:11:34,870
After this war,

182
00:11:35,460 --> 00:11:36,250
I'll pay my respects.

183
00:11:39,460 --> 00:11:42,380
[To the Marshal
of the Southwest Army]

184
00:11:42,790 --> 00:11:43,720
Take this letter

185
00:11:44,200 --> 00:11:45,720
to the Marshal of the Southwest Army.

186
00:11:46,150 --> 00:11:47,550
He served
under the Late Empress's father.

187
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:48,670
In three days,

188
00:11:48,670 --> 00:11:49,510
the Blood Jade Ritual begins.

189
00:11:49,790 --> 00:11:51,270
Ask him to send troops
to aid the Emperor.

190
00:11:52,320 --> 00:11:54,510
But even if he agrees,

191
00:11:55,030 --> 00:11:55,790
without the military tally,

192
00:11:56,150 --> 00:11:57,480
how will the city gates be opened?

193
00:11:58,600 --> 00:11:59,600
I'll find a way.

194
00:12:02,670 --> 00:12:04,840
Are you staying
at the Fengyi Bureau alone?

195
00:12:08,150 --> 00:12:10,080
You're just like Madam Yun.

196
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:10,870
Every bit as stubborn.

197
00:12:11,840 --> 00:12:13,790
She stays at the Eastern Palace alone
to deal with the Crown Prince,

198
00:12:14,630 --> 00:12:16,720
yet you stay to hold this city
all on your own.

199
00:12:16,720 --> 00:12:17,480
I don't understand.

200
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:19,200
Why not face this together?

201
00:12:28,670 --> 00:12:29,600
After the punishment,

202
00:12:30,030 --> 00:12:30,910
the Gu became violent

203
00:12:31,790 --> 00:12:32,840
and spread through my body.

204
00:12:35,320 --> 00:12:36,360
Don't tell her about this.

205
00:12:37,440 --> 00:12:38,200
It's my fault.

206
00:12:40,080 --> 00:12:42,080
I failed to get the cure from Nanshan.

207
00:12:43,440 --> 00:12:44,670
This is not on you.

208
00:12:44,670 --> 00:12:45,670
Don't blame yourself.

209
00:12:46,550 --> 00:12:48,390
Just protect Madam Yun.

210
00:12:50,150 --> 00:12:51,790
She's His Majesty's only blood heir.

211
00:12:51,790 --> 00:12:52,670
The Grand Princess.

212
00:12:53,360 --> 00:12:54,750
She's kind,

213
00:12:54,750 --> 00:12:55,870
honorable,

214
00:12:56,320 --> 00:12:57,440
strong and brave.

215
00:12:58,000 --> 00:12:58,510
She will

216
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:00,750
be a good ruler.

217
00:13:03,150 --> 00:13:04,120
You mean

218
00:13:04,790 --> 00:13:06,240
you want Madam Yun as Empress Regnant?

219
00:13:07,910 --> 00:13:08,720
She can do it.

220
00:13:12,360 --> 00:13:13,120
It's from Madam Yun.

221
00:13:22,840 --> 00:13:23,720
The Golden Dragon Tally.

222
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:25,720
Whoever holds it

223
00:13:25,720 --> 00:13:26,790
commands all armies in the realm.

224
00:13:53,030 --> 00:13:55,360
Pei Zhao, you have to get it.

225
00:13:57,510 --> 00:13:59,360
She never believed you betrayed her.

226
00:13:59,790 --> 00:14:02,030
She's playing along,

227
00:14:02,770 --> 00:14:04,270
going into the tiger's den alone.

228
00:14:17,360 --> 00:14:19,240
Greetings, Your Highness.

229
00:14:19,910 --> 00:14:21,000
Lord Han, please sit.

230
00:14:21,630 --> 00:14:22,600
Thank you, Your Highness.

231
00:14:25,510 --> 00:14:26,550
Leave us.

232
00:14:38,910 --> 00:14:39,910
Your Highness summoned me.

233
00:14:40,630 --> 00:14:42,320
What can I do for you?

234
00:14:42,880 --> 00:14:43,790
No one's here.

235
00:14:44,240 --> 00:14:44,750
Father.

236
00:14:46,750 --> 00:14:47,200
Huh?

237
00:15:08,510 --> 00:15:09,750
I remember when I was little,

238
00:15:10,870 --> 00:15:11,720
every time

239
00:15:12,240 --> 00:15:13,630
you came to the palace, you'd hold me.

240
00:15:14,670 --> 00:15:15,480
Once,

241
00:15:15,960 --> 00:15:17,390
you even stayed all night.

242
00:15:20,550 --> 00:15:21,480
That time,

243
00:15:24,480 --> 00:15:25,390
you had a high fever.

244
00:15:27,240 --> 00:15:28,360
Your mother

245
00:15:29,790 --> 00:15:31,320
sent an urgent letter

246
00:15:31,320 --> 00:15:32,360
to the border.

247
00:15:32,720 --> 00:15:33,630
I brought

248
00:15:34,080 --> 00:15:35,360
a famous physician,

249
00:15:35,360 --> 00:15:37,510
riding six horses to death to return.

250
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:39,080
That night,

251
00:15:40,030 --> 00:15:41,240
I was terrified.

252
00:15:41,960 --> 00:15:43,080
I held you

253
00:15:43,550 --> 00:15:44,960
and never let go.

254
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:53,120
If only Mother Consort

255
00:15:53,840 --> 00:15:55,030
had never entered the palace,

256
00:15:56,480 --> 00:15:58,480
I wouldn't have
had to call another man Father.

257
00:15:59,510 --> 00:16:01,670
I could've called you Father openly,

258
00:16:02,440 --> 00:16:03,600
called her Mother,

259
00:16:04,600 --> 00:16:05,720
and the three of us

260
00:16:06,120 --> 00:16:07,550
could've lived freely

261
00:16:07,870 --> 00:16:09,150
at the border.

262
00:16:10,080 --> 00:16:11,360
Life at the border is hard.

263
00:16:12,480 --> 00:16:13,960
Not easy at all.

264
00:16:16,200 --> 00:16:17,120
Then, Father,

265
00:16:18,360 --> 00:16:19,600
do you like the capital?

266
00:16:20,840 --> 00:16:21,720
Or

267
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:24,080
the palace?

268
00:16:25,720 --> 00:16:27,360
If you want the throne,

269
00:16:28,480 --> 00:16:29,670
I'll gladly

270
00:16:30,360 --> 00:16:31,510
fight for you

271
00:16:32,150 --> 00:16:33,030
and die for you.

272
00:16:34,510 --> 00:16:35,600
What nonsense.

273
00:16:42,910 --> 00:16:44,790
I just want you to dote on me, Father.

274
00:16:46,360 --> 00:16:47,910
Mother Consort only cares for Pei Zhao.

275
00:16:48,870 --> 00:16:50,030
She doesn't like me.

276
00:17:02,960 --> 00:17:03,750
Qingyan.

277
00:17:06,110 --> 00:17:07,510
Does it matter

278
00:17:07,920 --> 00:17:08,790
who loves you?

279
00:17:09,880 --> 00:17:10,790
You have me.

280
00:17:12,480 --> 00:17:13,310
In three days,

281
00:17:13,640 --> 00:17:15,000
at the Blood Jade Ritual,

282
00:17:16,350 --> 00:17:19,000
you'll become Emperor of Yong.

283
00:17:22,160 --> 00:17:22,920
Then who

284
00:17:25,110 --> 00:17:27,110
would dare look down on you?

285
00:17:27,350 --> 00:17:27,880
Huh?

286
00:17:28,590 --> 00:17:29,550
Thank you, Father.

287
00:17:38,790 --> 00:17:39,680
Come.

288
00:17:39,680 --> 00:17:40,110
Father.

289
00:17:40,830 --> 00:17:41,790
Let me

290
00:17:41,790 --> 00:17:42,960
toast you again.

291
00:17:50,510 --> 00:17:52,070
I will

292
00:17:53,070 --> 00:17:54,270
fight for you

293
00:17:55,590 --> 00:17:56,550
without regret.

294
00:17:59,880 --> 00:18:00,590
Guards.

295
00:18:13,650 --> 00:18:16,460
♪A cold blade gleams by the window♪

296
00:18:18,080 --> 00:18:21,270
♪Candle tears harden into frost♪

297
00:18:22,590 --> 00:18:24,330
♪Moon shadows flicker and sway♪

298
00:18:24,830 --> 00:18:29,270
♪A wisp of longing haunts the air♪

299
00:18:31,430 --> 00:18:34,100
♪A lone boat rests on the misty river♪

300
00:18:35,320 --> 00:18:40,330
♪That promise lies sealed with my sword♪

301
00:18:40,650 --> 00:18:48,680
♪I turn to find the world in snow♪

302
00:18:48,950 --> 00:18:57,570
♪Fated destiny ties from bygone life♪

303
00:18:57,570 --> 00:19:06,240
♪Longing for one beloved flows on♪

304
00:19:06,620 --> 00:19:15,490
♪I can't let go of the verses lost
across this vast land♪

305
00:19:15,920 --> 00:19:24,410
♪Yet I let go of that fleeting light
within your eyes♪
